<p>Aaj koofe me shabbir o shabbar ro rahe hai<br />
Baap ko apne zahra ke dilbar ro rahe hai</p>

<p>Behrobar me hai ghul aaj barpa waa Ali ka<br />
aaj jibreel arshe baree'n par ro rahe hai</p>

<p>Aaj shehzaadiya'n hai pareshaan'n shaahe zeeshaa'n<br />
uthke taskeen do behre daawar ro rahe hai</p>

<p>Ae yateemo'n ke bewo'n ke waali shaahe aali<br />
Ab na waaris raha koi sar par ro rahe hai</p>

<p>Hai janaaze pa ek shor barpa bekaso'n ka <br />
baap se lipte shabbir o shabbar ro rahe hai</p>

<p>Qaak udhaate hai sar par nawaase mustafa ke<br />
Ghar se jaata hai taaboote hyder ro rahe hai</p>

<p>Ae himaayat azadare hyder peet kar sar<br />
Aaj is tere nouhe ko sunkar ro rahe hai<br />
</p>